aegis-control (1.3.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add aegis-tor-connection: a standalone, Tails-style "Connect to Tor"
    assistant with live bootstrap progress, automatic/bridge connection, an
    outbound-port selector (the VPN-port analog), and an auto-reroute timer
    (new circuit every N minutes/hours). Autostarts at login until connected.
  * Custom routes: the Control Center's split-tunnel page is renamed "Custom
    routes" and now reads the persisted stores directly, so added IP and domain
    routes actually appear (and persist) instead of showing empty.

 -- Aegis OS <aegis@aegis-os.localdomain>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 17:49:24 +0000

aegis-control (1.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: GTK Control Center — network-mode switcher, live
    Tor/I2P/firewall status, MAC spoofing, update check and panic wipe.
  * Rebuilt as a full sidebar app: Status, Tor (Tails-style bootstrap %, connect,
    new circuit, obfs4/meek bridges), I2P (status, console, start/stop), VPN
    (import/connect WireGuard + OpenVPN, VPN kill-switch mode) and Split-tunnel
    (exclude apps, sites/domains and IPs from the tunnel).

 -- Aegis OS <aegis@aegis-os.localdomain>  Sat, 01 Nov 2026 10:05:00 +0000
